This Node.js code uses the node-auth0 SDK to refresh a token and store its expiry. Migrate the auth0 usage to @auth0/auth0-auth-js.

```ts
import { AuthenticationClient } from 'auth0';
const auth0 = new AuthenticationClient({ domain, clientId, clientSecret });
async function refresh(rt) {
  const resp = await auth0.oauth.refreshTokenGrant({ refresh_token: rt });
  const expiresAtMs = Date.now() + resp.data.expires_in * 1000;
  return { accessToken: resp.data.access_token, expiresAtMs };
}
```

